{"id":"ne_anmoins","lemma":"néanmoins","pos":"adv","rank":3946,"glosses":["however","nevertheless, nonetheless"],"ipa":"/ne.ɑ̃.mwɛ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b7/Fr-n%C3%A9anmoins.ogg/Fr-n%C3%A9anmoins.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"C'est néanmoins vrai.","en":"It is none the less true.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"true"}]},{"text":"C'est néanmoins le mien.","en":"It's still mine.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"mine"]]},{"text":"C'est néanmoins la mienne.","en":"It's still mine.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Cela peut paraître étrange, mais c'est néanmoins vrai.","en":"It sounds strange, but it is true none the less.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to appear"},{"g":"strange"},{"g":"but"},{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"true"}]},{"text":"Ma femme a fauté. Néanmoins, je l'aime.","en":"My wife has faults. None the less, I love her.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"mon"},{"g":"woman"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},null,null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"}]}]}